{"sentences":[{"id":"s_work_cdt_8_1","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_8","textTraditional":"一、八年，春，宋公、衞侯遇于垂。","sentenceOrder":1},{"id":"s_work_cdt_8_2","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_8","textTraditional":"二、三月，鄭伯使宛來歸邴。庚寅，我入邴。","sentenceOrder":2},{"id":"s_work_cdt_8_3","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_8","textTraditional":"宛者何？鄭之微者也。邴者何？鄭湯沐之邑也。天子有事于泰山，諸侯皆從。泰山之下，諸侯皆有湯沐之邑焉。其言入何？難也。其日何？難也。其言我何？言我者非獨我也，齊亦欲之。","sentenceOrder":3},{"id":"s_work_cdt_8_4","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_8","textTraditional":"三、夏，六月己亥，蔡侯考父卒。","sentenceOrder":4},{"id":"s_work_cdt_8_5","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_8","textTraditional":"四、辛亥，宿男卒。","sentenceOrder":5},{"id":"s_work_cdt_8_6","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_8","textTraditional":"五、秋，七月庚午，宋公、齊侯、衞侯盟于瓦屋。","sentenceOrder":6},{"id":"s_work_cdt_8_7","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_8","textTraditional":"六、八月，葬蔡宣公。","sentenceOrder":7},{"id":"s_work_cdt_8_8","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_8","textTraditional":"卒何以名而葬不名？卒從正，而葬從主人。卒何以日而葬不日？卒赴，而葬不告。","sentenceOrder":8},{"id":"s_work_cdt_8_9","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_8","textTraditional":"七、九月辛卯，公及莒人盟于包來。","sentenceOrder":9},{"id":"s_work_cdt_8_10","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_8","textTraditional":"公曷為與微者盟？稱人則從不疑也。","sentenceOrder":10},{"id":"s_work_cdt_8_11","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_8","textTraditional":"八、螟。","sentenceOrder":11},{"id":"s_work_cdt_8_12","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_8","textTraditional":"九、冬，十有二月，無駭卒。","sentenceOrder":12},{"id":"s_work_cdt_8_13","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_8","textTraditional":"此展無駭也，何以不氏？疾始滅也，故終其身不氏。","sentenceOrder":13}],"overrides":{}}